# AI Integration Standards

- Keep provider calls behind a thin interface so models/providers are swappable.
- Require schema-constrained outputs and validate responses before applying side effects.
- Version prompts with code changes and keep revisions reviewable.

# Retrieval and Quality

- For RAG-style work: deterministic chunk/embed strategy, stable vector storage, clear retrieval contract.
- Validate retrieval and generation behavior against a golden/eval set before shipping risky changes.

# Operational Guardrails

- Track quota/cost at request level.
- Remove unused token/accounting surfaces rather than carrying dead telemetry.
- Keep timeout/retry behavior explicit in both API and UI layers.
